IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-companies-domain`

§ `Part 11 — Various Types of Companies`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Companies Act 1967 (Singapore), Part 11, ss 365–386.
-- Source: SSO current version as at 07 Sep 2026.
--
-- Division 1: Repealed by Act 8 of 2003.
-- Division 2: Foreign companies — registration, obligations, striking
-- off. This encoding covers the computable deadlines and thresholds.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Division 2 — Foreign companies`


§§§ `s 366 — Carrying on business`

-- s 366(2)(h): isolated transaction must complete within 31 days
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 366(2)(h)"
`isolated transaction maximum days` MEANS 31


§§§ `s 368A — Director and authorised representative information`

-- s 368A(1),(2): 14 days to provide information
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 368A(1)–(2)"
`foreign company director information days` MEANS 14


§§§ `s 370 — Registered office and authorised representatives`

-- s 370(1): office must be open >= 5 hours between 9am-5pm each business day
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 370(1)"
`foreign company office minimum hours` MEANS 5

-- s 370(5): authorised representative ceases 21 days after lodging notice
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 370(5)"
`authorised representative cessation days` MEANS 21

-- s 370(7): 21 days to replace deceased sole authorised representative
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 370(7)"
`sole representative replacement days after death` MEANS 21


§§§ `s 372 — Lodgement of changes`

-- s 372(1): 30 days to lodge changes
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 372(1)"
`foreign company change lodgement days` MEANS 30


§§§ `s 373 — Financial statements`

-- s 373(3)(a): lodge within 60 days after AGM
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 373(3)(a)"
`foreign company financial statement days after AGM` MEANS 60

-- s 373(18): penalty for non-compliance
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 373(18)"
`penalty for foreign company financial statement default` MEANS 10000


§§§ `s 377 — Cessation of business`

-- s 377(1): 7 days to lodge cessation notice
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 377(1)"
`foreign company cessation notice days` MEANS 7

-- s 377(2): 14 days for liquidation/dissolution notice
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 377(2)"
`foreign company liquidation notice days` MEANS 14

-- s 377(9)(b): 6 months to appoint authorised representative after death
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 377(9)(b)"
`authorised representative appointment months after death` MEANS 6

-- s 377(10): 12 months for sole authorised representative resignation trigger
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 377(10)"
`sole representative resignation strike off months` MEANS 12


§§§ `s 377A — Administrative restoration of foreign company`

-- s 377A(2): 6-year window
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 377A(2)"
`foreign company restoration years` MEANS 6


§§§ `s 377D — Effect of restoration`

-- s 377D(4): 3-year window for court directions
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 377D(4)"
`foreign company post restoration court direction years` MEANS 3


§§§ `s 378 — Name restrictions for foreign companies`

-- s 378(5): 6 weeks to comply with direction to change name
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 378(5)"
`foreign company name change compliance weeks` MEANS 6


§§§ `s 379 — Register of members`

-- s 379(1): 30 days to set up register of members after registration
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 379(1)"
`foreign company member register days` MEANS 30

-- s 379(2): 60 days for pre-existing companies (before 31 March 2017)
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 379(2)"
`foreign company member register days pre existing` MEANS 60

-- s 380(2)(b): 14 days to update member index
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 380(2)(b)"
`foreign company member index update days` MEANS 14

-- s 380(4): 30 days to update member register
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 380(4)"
`foreign company member register update days` MEANS 30


