§§ `Part 11 — Illustrations`

#ASSERT `isolated transaction maximum days` EQUALS 31
#ASSERT `foreign company director information days` EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `authorised representative cessation days` EQUALS 21
#ASSERT `foreign company change lodgement days` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `foreign company financial statement days after AGM` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `foreign company cessation notice days` EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `foreign company liquidation notice days` EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `foreign company restoration years` EQUALS 6
